 Packing keeps `[strings]` as top-level PAK content; only `[ps]` and `[ps_common]` are written into `initial.cache_block`. Regular assets use ZIP deflate compression (while `pak.load_list` and `.pct_header` files are stored) to avoid producing archives several times larger than the original.
 
 Small improvements: Engines uses a short one-line description; Custom tires include their underlying category. The shared search uses Tab/Shift+Tab to cycle focus through matches, wrapping at either end. Farming Tractor is an app-only class for Ankatra 1160, Futom 7290RA, Kirovets K-700 and K-7M; XML TruckType values are preserved. The Unpack / Pack tab has a bottom activity bar that animates while unpacking/merging or packing, and resets on completion, cancellation or error. Replacement comparisons hide hood-ornament and miscellaneous addon categories and the requested technical fields, with only Compatible families and scale under Wheels.
